            <p>update:</p>

<p><b>Title</b>:</p>
<h2><a name="Misspelleditemname%3AOnThurday%22CabbageSoup%22showing%22CabadgeSoup%22%C2%A0"></a>Misspelled item name: On Thurday "Cabbage Soup" showing "Cabadge Soup" </h2>

<p><b>Priority</b>: Major<br/>
<b>Environment:</b><br/>
OS: Windows 11 (64-bit)<br/>
Browser: Google Chrome 150.0.7871.115</p>

<p><b>Step</b> :</p>
<ul>
	<li>Open <a href="https://test-dinner-eng.demohoster.com/dinner.html" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Calllculation of dinners in the Online Cafe</a></li>
	<li>click on drop down &amp; select Thursday</li>
	<li>see the menu's one  of the item Cabadge Soup 129.3 rub.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : Cabbage is showing Cabadge Soup 129.3 rub.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : It need to be show cabbage Soup 129.3 rub.</p>

<p> </p>
