	<li>Select monday </li>
	<li>select a single food place order </li>
	<li>again select that food place order (do it 5 times) </li>
</ul>


<p> <b>Actual result</b> : every order system deduct 50 rubles from food cost when order is confirmed </p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : After crossing limited food odering system will stop thake that order</p>
