	<li>Open <a href="https://test-dinner-eng.demohoster.com/dinner.html" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Calllculation of dinners in the Online Cafe</a></li>
	<li>Select all food from each day</li>
	<li>place order on any one day</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : The order history displays only the food items from the selected day, but the account balance is deducted based on the total cost of food items selected from all menu days <span class="nobr"><a href="https://jira.a1qa.com/secure/attachment/2814229/2814229_image-2026-07-16-22-30-25-315.png" title="image-2026-07-16-22-30-25-315.png attached to QATC-1009222">image-2026-07-16-22-30-25-315.png<sup><img class="rendericon" src="https://jira.a1qa.com/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span></p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : Order have to take only that selected day's selected food.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

