    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Step</b> :</p>
<ul>
	<li>Open <a href="https://test-dinner-eng.demohoster.com/dinner.html" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Calllculation of dinners in the Online Cafe</a></li>
	<li>Select Monday &gt; Pilaf 150 rub.</li>
	<li>Move on Tuesday  </li>
	<li>place order</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> :  order place as Tuesday with Monday's selected food and deducted account balance <span class="nobr"><a href="https://jira.a1qa.com/secure/attachment/2813536/2813536_image-2026-07-16-12-32-40-056.png" title="image-2026-07-16-12-32-40-056.png attached to QATC-1008790">image-2026-07-16-12-32-40-056.png<sup><img class="rendericon" src="https://jira.a1qa.com/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span><span class="nobr"><a href="https://jira.a1qa.com/secure/attachment/2813535/2813535_image-2026-07-16-12-33-17-210.png" title="image-2026-07-16-12-33-17-210.png attached to QATC-1008790">image-2026-07-16-12-33-17-210.png<sup><img class="rendericon" src="https://jira.a1qa.com/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span></p>

<p> </p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : It should show empty order ,<b>no amount should be deducted</b> from the account balance.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

