<h2><a name="OrderPlacing%3AAfterplacingoneorderinTuesday%2C%C2%A0theninsecondorderonFridayitplacedorderbutthebillwasnotdeducted%C2%A0"></a>Order Placing: After placing one order in Tuesday,  then in second order on Friday it placed order but the bill was not deducted </h2>

<p>Environment  : Windows 11 x64 bit</p>

<p>                         Google Chrome 150.0.7871.115</p>

<p> </p>

<p><b>Step:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Open Menu Calculator </li>
	<li>Select Tuesday&gt;caesar salad&gt;place order</li>
	<li>order completed ad showing the reduced bill</li>
	<li>Again select Friday&gt;Select Fried Cauliflower&gt;Make the order </li>
	<li>order history showing those 2 order </li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result :</b> In second order 0 rub has been deducted</p>

<p><b>Expected Result :</b> Second order should deduct the actual cost which is 50 rub </p>
